## 3. Deployment Strategy
Implementation follows a strict phased deployment approach. To ensure infrastructure integrity, each phase must achieve the following before proceeding to the subsequent phase:
* Complete successfully with zero critical errors.
* Pass all defined validation testing.
* Be fully documented within the central knowledge base.
* Have an immutable base backup/snapshot executed.

