## 5. Rollback Plan

| Platform Segment | Rollback Method | Target Recovery Time (RTO) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Hypervisor / Infra** | Restore Proxmox node configurations; revert upstream hardware/VLAN modifications. | Minimal |
| **Active Directory** | Revert to stable Proxmox VM Snapshot; perform system state restore if replicating. | Critical / Fast |
| **Linux Servers** | Revert VM Snapshot; redeploy cleanly via baseline server templates if corrupted. | Minimal |
| **Docker Services** | Restore target Docker data volumes; rerun application deployment via Docker Compose files. | Minimal |

