## 6. Risk Register

| ID | Identified Risk | Impact | Likelihood | Mitigation Strategy |
| :---: | :--- | :---: | :---: | :--- |
| **R1** | Core DNS / Name Resolution Failure | High | Medium | Implement secondary/fallback DNS configuration targets. |
| **R2** | Local Storage Pool Outage or Failure | High | Low | Enforce regular schedule backups directly off-site/to NFS. |
| **R3** | VM Corruption during patching/updates | Medium | Medium | Mandate automated pre-patching Proxmox snapshots. |
| **R4** | Configuration Drift across system endpoints | Medium | High | Enforce version control using Git & deploy configurations via Ansible. |
| **|R5** | Security Misconfiguration / Weak Access Controls | High | Medium | Perform structured audits utilizing an infrastructure hardening checklist. |

