## 8. Testing Plan

### Functional Testing
Validate:
* Cross-platform domain authentication mechanisms.
* Internal DNS resolution across separate subnets.
* DHCP Lease Assignments across distinct client scopes.
* Centralized Monitoring telemetry collection accuracy.
* Security event pipeline tracking via SIEM framework.
* Regular system backup routines.

### Performance Testing
Validate:
* Server CPU Utilization thresholds under active stress.
* RAM footprint consumption metrics.
* IOPS and general disk storage read/write limits.
* End-to-end network traffic processing speeds.

### Recovery Testing
Validate:
* Total bare-metal VM restoration times.
* Granular configuration restoration efficiency.
* Storage backup repository failover capabilities.

